}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that minimum output occurs.\n\nFrom the graph, \n\n- the highest point is at $(2,3),$ so ${max}_{x\\in T}h(x)=3$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in T}h(x)=2,$ and\n\n- the lowest point is at $(3,-2),$ so ${min}_{x\\in T}h(x)=-2$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}h(x)=3.$"} :step/id #uuid "91db8244-3685-5e70-84f7-d0eb181b472e" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186550108}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186550108 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186549997 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "345f29ad-2588-54f8-8dc3-d0f0aec27dbf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549426}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186549426} :answer-field/id #uuid "8551d14e-f39e-5ce7-89d2-c9a38c962ec1" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549859} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "75cdc5b9-9dec-5a0f-bc1a-5a5e1d3cd4b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549539}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186549539} :answer-field/id #uuid "8675a2d0-f0b9-5671-b4e9-542faadaf08e" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549861} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2653f55c-a848-5ceb-93c2-ee5d54190236" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549397}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186549397} :answer-field/id #uuid "98cdcfef-73eb-5109-837e-d6d180759288" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549876} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "808c6ac2-7cdb-5744-a6b4-4c434e8287a9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549554}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186549554} :answer-field/id #uuid "af7f54bf-03f1-58f9-aac6-29043dd60cad" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549884}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "c6c0cc6c-d71f-5404-a9ca-d9e5fa0bb209" :question/math-academy-id "q-355239" :question/problem "![](images/6d/6d8fc9840369a69316c97a443e055bac2cc7b3972c266462c05b1b89424da524.png)\n\nLet $T=\\{-3,-2,-1,0,1\\}.$ The graph above shows the value of $g(x)$ for each $x\\in T.$ Assuming that all the dots have integer coordinates, compute the following:\n\n${max}_{x\\in T}g(x)=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in T}g(x)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{x\\in T}g(x)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}g(x)=$\n{{field-4}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the maximum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that maximum output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the minimum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that minimum output occurs.\n\nFrom the graph, \n\n- the highest point is at $(-1,4),$ so ${max}_{x\\in T}g(x)=4$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in T}g(x)=-1,$ and\n\n- the lowest point is at $(-2,-1),$ so ${min}_{x\\in T}g(x)=-1$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}g(x)=-2.$"} :step/id #uuid "d987c069-950d-51ec-b40d-d6b2adce6a4e" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186550041}}] :activity/title "Finding Argmax and Argmin From Tables and Graphs" :activity/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :activity.type/review} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186549317}]}
